    "Narmada Infotech Ltd": "FY25 $500 mn at ₹80 = ₹4,000 cr; dollar costs $175 mn (₹1,400 cr); rupee costs ₹1,760 cr (44%); op profit ₹840 cr (21%). FY26 base: cc +5%, ₹84 → revenue ₹4,410 cr (+10.25%), op profit ₹1,018.5 cr (23.1%). Same work at ₹84: profit 970 (+15.5%), margin 23.1%; at ₹76: 710. Half of $325 mn net dollars hedged at ₹80: ±₹65 cr → 905/775. Deal: $300 mn TCV over 5 yrs, $200 mn renewal ($40 mn/yr), $100 mn net new; $60 mn/yr billed. Euro client €100 mn ($107→$116 mn at real Infosys avg rates).",
    "Tapti Pharma Ltd": "US sales $200 mn: plant A injectables 60, B tablets 90, C creams 50; 20 pending approvals, 8 from plant A; import alert at A removes $60 mn (30%)."
